---
title: Button Event Counter - FreeRTOS ISR Offloading
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant HW as Button (EXTI0)
    participant ISR as EXTI0 ISR
    participant BTN as Button Task
    participant Q as Event Queue
    participant CNT as Counter Task
    participant LED as LEDs

    HW->>ISR: button edge (press / release)
    ISR->>ISR: clear EXTI flag
    ISR->>BTN: xTaskNotifyFromISR()
    ISR-->>HW: return (ISR stays short)

    BTN->>BTN: debounce (sample for debounce window)
    alt press confirmed
        BTN->>Q: xQueueSend(EVENT_PRESS)
    end

    loop while button held
        BTN->>BTN: PressDetector_Update()
        alt long-press
            BTN->>Q: xQueueSend(EVENT_LONG_PRESS)
        end
    end

    loop forever
        CNT->>Q: xQueueReceive(timeout 10 ms)
        alt event received
            CNT->>CNT: press -> increment / long-press -> reset
        end
        CNT->>LED: CounterDisplay_Show(pressed, count)
    end